ADDITIONAL NOTICE

This project interacts with the Telegram API at my.telegram.org.
Your APP ID and API HASH are sensitive credentials.

  • Never share them publicly.
  • Telegram explicitly states: "It is forbidden to pass this value to third parties."
  • This software is provided for personal, educational use only.
  • The author (yuchann) is not responsible for any misuse of this tool.

By using ScrapChan, you agree that you are responsible for securing your own
Telegram credentials and that you will run your own private instance of this
bot rather than trusting any publicly deployed version.
